WEBVTT

00:59:56.109 --> 01:00:00.029
and the number of workers
being displaced is significant,

01:00:00.053 --> 01:00:01.975
and the large population,

01:00:01.999 --> 01:00:04.659
which used to be viewed
as an asset, is a liability.

01:00:04.982 --> 01:00:06.433
So with all these problems,

01:00:06.457 --> 01:00:10.268
I think each country needs
to figure out its own plan.

01:00:10.292 --> 01:00:12.705
I think the more populous countries

01:00:12.729 --> 01:00:16.665
can see if they can use their own
population and data

01:00:16.689 --> 01:00:19.181
to create some kind of an AI industry,

01:00:19.205 --> 01:00:21.855
because they've got
the population and the data.

01:00:21.879 --> 01:00:25.156
The countries with the technologies
should get stronger and stronger

01:00:25.180 --> 01:00:29.267
and train more AI people,
like Israel has done.

01:00:29.737 --> 01:00:34.658
And many other countries,
who can't really do either,